'''Duel Stages Challenge''' (決闘チャレンジ, ''Kettō Charenji'', '''Duel Challenge''') is an event added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. It consists of all [[Duel Stages]] in a single map. Progress made in Duel Stages Challenge will reset when the event ends.

==About==
Each stage has a Cat Deploy Limit and enemy limit of 1. Taking over 15 minutes to beat any one stage will cause an [[Assassin Bear]] to spawn.

